{"id":"659721","name":"黄皮龙骨汤","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/659721/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"黄皮","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"龙骨","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"龙骨冷水下锅焯烫出血水后洗净备用。","img":"images/659721/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"黄皮加入适量盐浸泡清洗。","img":"images/659721/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"龙骨放入珐琅锅里。","img":"images/659721/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"加入适量清水。","img":"images/659721/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"大火煮开转小火。","img":"images/659721/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"盖上继续小火煲一个小时。","img":"images/659721/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"浸泡过的黄皮去核备用。","img":"images/659721/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"将黄皮倒入汤里。","img":"images/659721/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"继续小火再煲多20至30分钟。","img":"images/659721/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"出锅前少许盐调味即可。","img":"images/659721/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/659721/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/659721/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/659721/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}